<title>USA: CCC seeks 42,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Ethiopia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 42,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Ethiopia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking up to 42,000 tonnes of U.S. no.2 or better hard red winter wheat under its export program for Ethiopia.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the shipment period was set July 15-July 30.</p>
<p>Offers were due on June 26.</p>
<p>The wheat must originate in areas of the United States where Karnal Bunt is not known to occur.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
